WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.380
I felt that I was successful at doing 4-H work and the primary reason, of course,

2
00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:12.100
I had been . . . I was raised in 4-H and FFA,

3
00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:18.420
but as a teacher I got to know the vo-ag teachers in St. James Parish.

4
00:00:18.420 --> 00:00:24.040
They had three high schools in St. James Parish and I got to know all the vo-ag teachers there in each of the schools.

5
00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:31.800
And consequently, when I went to work in St. James Parish, because of the fact that I knew them,

6
00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:37.560
I was able to call them to help me in the schools; so they were my local leaders.

7
00:00:37.560 --> 00:00:43.320
So again, it brought 4-H and FFA together.

8
00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:48.640
I came to Baton Rouge to the extension service’s state office.

9
00:00:48.640 --> 00:00:54.800
I became involved in sugarcane work and that was my specialty as an agronomist, in sugarcane.

10
00:00:54.800 --> 00:01:06.160
And because of that, I was able to pursue my PhD actually in sugarcane because I was doing technical work as an extension specialist.

11
00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:11.600
If you ask me what was the highlight of my career as a director,

12
00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:21.300
I would pinpoint the fact that I was instrumental in improving the technical background of agents;

13
00:01:21.300 --> 00:01:32.800
allowed them to go to school here at LSU or, in many cases, Northeast, Natchitoches, or Southwestern, or Nicholls.

14
00:01:32.800 --> 00:01:36.520
We had a lot of people who got master’s degrees from those institutions.

15
00:01:36.520 --> 00:01:53.260
When I was director I had the first computer put on my desk and I required . . . as director I required that at least one computer be put in every parish in the state.

16
00:01:53.260 --> 00:01:58.320
If they could get the [?] of the school board to buy it, they did that.

17
00:01:58.320 --> 00:02:03.080
If not, I had a little extra money that was allocated for that purpose.

18
00:02:03.080 --> 00:02:12.620
But within a year I maintained that you get a computer . . . that extension staff has a computer in their office.

19
00:02:12.620 --> 00:02:16.280
I never learned to use it [laughs].
